<title>USA: Cyrix lowers processor prices.</title>
<headline>Cyrix lowers processor prices.</headline>
<dateline>RICHARDSON, Texas 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyrix Corp said on Tuesday after the market closed that it is reducing prices across its 6x86 processor family for the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The company said processor prices range from $98 to $299.</p>
<p>All prices are for unit quantities of 1,000 and are effective immediately, it said.</p>
</text>
